{
    "title": "HeritCoin: AI Identify Coins",
    "description": "Easy Operation!\r\nHeritCoin is your ultimate coin identifier, using AI and expert knowledge to identify coins and notes through photo identification. Our app helps numismatists, collectors, and hobbyists quickly understand and value their collections.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n1.Effortless Identification:\r\nIdentify the value of your coins and notes through photo identification. Expand your collection with every new item you discover.\r\n2.Expert Appraisal Services:\r\nNeed to verify the authenticity and get accurate valuations? HeritCoin connects you with experts for precise coin and note identification and appraisals.\r\n3.Accurate AI Recognition Results:\r\nCurious about the value and history of your coins? Use HeritCoin, the ideal coin identifier, to get insights into value, price, and historical significance through photo identification.\r\n4.Seamless Transactions:\r\nExplore our new feature! Buy and sell coins and notes directly within the app. List your items, browse others' listings, and engage in secure transactions\u2014all in one place.\r\n\r\nTwo Steps to Identify Your Collection:\r\n1.Take a clear photo of both sides of your coin or note.\r\n2.Discover detailed information, including specifications, price, and value.\r\n\r\nDiscover More with App Features:\r\n1.Identify coins and notes effortlessly through photo identification.\r\n2.Get precise identification for small cents, large cents, nickels, dimes, quarters, half dollars, and dollars.\r\n3.Identify ancient, error, and rare coins through photo identification.\r\n4.Receive detailed info, including name, year, weight, and metal.\r\n5.Organize and appraise your entire collection in one app.\r\n6.Buy and sell coins and notes with our new trading functionality.\r\n\r\nStay Updated:\r\nExciting features are coming soon! We\u2019re always updating our database, so stay connected for the latest news.\r\n\r\nConnect with Us:\r\nWhatsApp\uff1a+1\uff08213\uff09924-0764\r\nEmail: contactus@heritcoin.com\r\nFollow us on TikTok: @heritcoin\r\nFacebook: HeritCoin\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Matters:\r\nWe protect your data according to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nUncover the secrets of your collection with HeritCoin. Download now and start your coin-collecting journey!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Easy Operation!<br>HeritCoin is your ultimate coin identifier, using AI and expert knowledge to identify coins and notes through photo identification. Our app helps numismatists, collectors, and hobbyists quickly understand and value their collections.<br><br>Key Features:<br>1.Effortless Identification:<br>Identify the value of your coins and notes through photo identification. Expand your collection with every new item you discover.<br>2.Expert Appraisal Services:<br>Need to verify the authenticity and get accurate valuations? HeritCoin connects you with experts for precise coin and note identification and appraisals.<br>3.Accurate AI Recognition Results:<br>Curious about the value and history of your coins? Use HeritCoin, the ideal coin identifier, to get insights into value, price, and historical significance through photo identification.<br>4.Seamless Transactions:<br>Explore our new feature! Buy and sell coins and notes directly within the app. List your items, browse others&#39; listings, and engage in secure transactions\u2014all in one place.<br><br>Two Steps to Identify Your Collection:<br>1.Take a clear photo of both sides of your coin or note.<br>2.Discover detailed information, including specifications, price, and value.<br><br>Discover More with App Features:<br>1.Identify coins and notes effortlessly through photo identification.<br>2.Get precise identification for small cents, large cents, nickels, dimes, quarters, half dollars, and dollars.<br>3.Identify ancient, error, and rare coins through photo identification.<br>4.Receive detailed info, including name, year, weight, and metal.<br>5.Organize and appraise your entire collection in one app.<br>6.Buy and sell coins and notes with our new trading functionality.<br><br>Stay Updated:<br>Exciting features are coming soon! We\u2019re always updating our database, so stay connected for the latest news.<br><br>Connect with Us:<br>WhatsApp\uff1a+1\uff08213\uff09924-0764<br>Email: contactus@heritcoin.com<br>Follow us on TikTok: @heritcoin<br>Facebook: HeritCoin<br><br>Your Privacy Matters:<br>We protect your data according to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.<br><br>Uncover the secrets of your collection with HeritCoin. Download now and start your coin-collecting journey!",
